          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ఉద్భవించు",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఉద్భవించు — udbhaviñcu — \"to originate; to spring from\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఆ ఆచారం చాలా పాత కాలంలో ఉద్భవించింది. ā ācāraṁ cālā pāta kālaṁlō udbhaviñcindi. That custom arose in very old times."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (it …): ఉద్భవించింది, udbhaviñcindi."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Formal: for customs, ideas, languages and rivers, so its past is shown as ఉద్భవించింది, it arose."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఉద్భవించు (udbhaviñcu) is built on Sanskrit udbhava, \"origin, birth\" (CDIAL 2039), from the root bhū, \"to become\", with the Telugu verb ending -ఇంచు."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
